# The build context is an allowlist: only the workspace manifest, the
# lockfile and the directories the stages copy are sent to the builder.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!backend
!frontend
!deploy
!targets

# Inside those, nothing a host built or installed: the stages install
# from the lockfiles and produce their own outputs.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/target
**/target-*
